Check csirsPoolingGroupId in CPRT Cellsetup Capture
    [Documentation]     When rdMaxNumStreamPrbL1Ratio RAD parameter is set to 24%, checking
    ...                 that CPRT provides Two csirsPoolingGroup in itf_l2_ps_cell_CellSetupReq
    ...                 and mapps each other on Two different Cells.

    Dated Log    [Checking csirsPoolingGroupId In CPRT itf_l2_ps_cell_CellSetupReq depending of physCellId]
    Dated Log    ----> convert pcap to pdml with filter itf_l2_ps_cell_cellsetupreq ......
    Dated Log    ----> pcap file : ${CaptureCPRT_ASIB.path}
    # ${filterPcap}                   analyzer.filter_pcap
    # ...                                 ${CaptureCPRT_ASIB.path}
    # ...                                 filterName=syscom
    #  ...                                 filterExp=sctp
    # ${pdmlFile}                    analyzer.pcap_to_pdml    ${filterPcap}
    ${pdmlFile}                    analyzer.pcap_to_pdml      ${CaptureCPRT_ASIB.path}
    # Dated Log              - When rdMaxNumStreamPrbL1Ratio=${ratio}%
    Dated log new line                      Getting some captured itf_l2_ps_cell_cellsetupreq on cell0
    @{itf_l2_ps_cell_cellsetupreq}          Get Packet Match List
    ...                                     pdmlFile=${pdmlFile}
    ...                                     packetName=itf_l2_ps_cell_CellSetupReq
    ...                                     pathList=${FIELDS_cell_cellsetupreq}
    ...                                     startPacket=${1}
    ...                                     endPacket=${1}
    Dated log new line                 - For cell0
    FOR     ${packet}   IN           @{itf_l2_ps_cell_cellsetupreq}
            ${physCellId_in_pcap}           Get Value In Packet Match
            ...                             packetMatch=${packet}
            ...                             field=physCellId

            ${csirsPoolingGroupId_in_pcap}             Get Value In Packet Match
            ...                                        packetMatch=${packet}
            ...                                        field=csirsPoolingGroupId
            Dated Log                  - physCellId=${physCellId_in_pcap}
            Dated Log                  - PoolingGroupId=${csirsPoolingGroupId_in_pcap}
            should be true              ${physCellId_in_pcap}==0x00000032
            should be true              ${csirsPoolingGroupId_in_pcap}==0x00000000
    END

    Dated log new line                      Getting some captured itf_l2_ps_cell_cellsetupreq on cell1
    @{itf_l2_ps_cell_cellsetupreq}          Get Packet Match List
    ...                                     pdmlFile=${pdmlFile}
    ...                                     packetName=itf_l2_ps_cell_CellSetupReq
    ...                                     pathList=${FIELDS_cell_cellsetupreq}
    ...                                     startPacket=${3}
    ...                                     endPacket=${3}
    Dated log new line                  - For cell1
    FOR     ${packet}   IN           @{itf_l2_ps_cell_cellsetupreq}

            ${physCellId_in_pcap}           Get Value In Packet Match
            ...                             packetMatch=${packet}
            ...                             field=physCellId

            ${csirsPoolingGroupId_in_pcap}             Get Value In Packet Match
            ...                                        packetMatch=${packet}
            ...                                        field=csirsPoolingGroupId
            Dated Log                  - physCellId=${physCellId_in_pcap}
            Dated Log                  - PoolingGroupId=${csirsPoolingGroupId_in_pcap}
            should be true              ${physCellId_in_pcap}==0x00000034
            should be true              ${csirsPoolingGroupId_in_pcap}==0x00000001
    END


